<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia trade surplus rises in 1996.</title>
<headline>Indonesia trade surplus rises in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $6,946.3 million in 1996 against $4,754.6 million in 1995, Information Minister Harmoko said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Following are the trade figures for 1996, in millions of dollars, with comparisons for 1995:</p>
<p>				  1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Trade balance	 +6,946.3    +4,789.4</p>
<p>    Exports		 49,815.5    45,418.1</p>
<p>    Imports		 42,869.2    40,628.7</p>
<p>    Oil/gas exports     11,720.9    10,470.9</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
